#: ../../algorithms.rst:40
msgid "Trie states and failure edges for two signatures"
msgstr "两个签名的字典树状态和失败边"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:64
msgid ""
"The automaton's state budget is a run-time option. The policy engine "
"reserves at most one root plus the sum of all signature lengths, a safe "
"upper bound on trie states. This avoids historically oversized fixed "
"tables while retaining a dense transition for every byte class. Each "
"pattern carries a small category tag (0 to 63, so a set of tags is one "
"64-bit word). Case folding uses a 256-entry byte-class table built with "
"the automaton: both cases of a letter share a class, and bytes that occur "
"in no pattern share one class, so a table row is as wide as the number of "
"distinct pattern bytes plus one rather than 256. Exact engine sizes and "
"the comparison with sequential substring search are recorded in Part "
"VIII. The latter uses the same patterns and any-match semantics."
msgstr ""
"自动机的状态预算是一个运行时选项。策略引擎最多预留一个根加上所有签名长度之和，这是字典树状态数的一个安全上界。这样既避免了以往过大的固定表，又为每个字节类保留了稠密的转移。每个模式带有一个小的类别标记（0 "
"到 63，因此一组标记就是一个 64 位字）。大小写折叠使用一张随自动机一起构建的 256 "
"项字节类表：一个字母的大小写形式共用一个类，所有不出现在任何模式中的字节共用一个类，因此表的一行的宽度等于不同模式字节的数量加一，而不是 "
"256。确切的引擎大小，以及与顺序子串搜索的比较，记录在第 VIII 部分中。后者使用相同的模式和“任一匹配”语义。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:66
msgid "Regular Expressions, SIMD Engines, and the Choice"
msgstr "正则表达式、SIMD 引擎与最终选择"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:69
msgid "Three families were weighed for the signature stage:"
msgstr "为签名阶段权衡过三类方案："

#: ../../algorithms.rst:71
msgid ""
"*Backtracking regular expressions* (a backtracking rule-set style) run "
"hundreds of patterns per request and allocate per match; they are the "
"slowest option and the most prone to false positives."
msgstr "*回溯式正则表达式*\\ （回溯规则集的风格）每个请求要运行数百个模式，每次匹配都要分配内存；它们是最慢的选项，也最容易产生误报。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:72
msgid ""
"*SIMD literal engines* (Hyperscan, Vectorscan) prefilter blocks of 16 to "
"32 bytes with shuffle-based nibble masks (the \"Teddy\" algorithm) and "
"verify candidates with automata. They excel on long inputs with large "
"literal sets. The cost is a multi-megabyte C++ dependency, a compile-time "
"pattern database, no WebAssembly target, and, for inputs of a hundred "
"bytes, no advantage: the whole field scans in less time than one cache "
"miss."
msgstr ""
"*SIMD 字面量引擎*\\ （Hyperscan、Vectorscan）用基于 shuffle 的半字节掩码（“Teddy”算法）对 16 到 "
"32 字节的数据块进行预过滤，再用自动机验证候选。它们擅长处理带有大型字面量集合的长输入。代价是一个数兆字节的 C++ "
"依赖、一个编译期的模式数据库、不支持 WebAssembly 目标，而且对于一百字节左右的输入没有优势：扫描整个字段的时间还不到一次缓存未命中。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:73
msgid ""
"*Dense Aho-Corasick plus small structural tokenizers*, the libinjection "
"lineage, gives exact linear-time behaviour in a fixed table and needs "
"nothing outside the binary."
msgstr ""
"*稠密 Aho-Corasick 加小型结构分词器*，即 libinjection "
"一脉的做法，在一张固定表中提供精确的线性时间行为，并且不需要可执行文件之外的任何东西。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:75
msgid ""
"Sibuna's fields are short, so the third family wins on both memory and "
"speed; Part VIII records about 1.56 ns per byte on an 8 KiB body (the "
"semantic scan takes 12,784.3 ns, ``8kb_body_semantic_scan`` in "
"``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.md``). That is the one workload "
"where a SIMD prefilter would pay, and SID 0006 keeps it as an open item."
msgstr ""
"Sibuna 的字段很短，因此第三类方案在内存和速度上都胜出；第 VIII 部分记录了 8 KiB 请求体上约每字节 1.56 ns "
"的成本（语义扫描耗时 12,784.3 ns，见 ``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.md`` 中的 "
"``8kb_body_semantic_scan``）。这是 SIMD 预过滤唯一可能值得的工作负载，SID 0006 把它列为一个待定事项。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:77
msgid "The Radix Trie for IPv4 and IPv6"
msgstr "IPv4 和 IPv6 的基数字典树"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:82
msgid ""
"Trace a longest-prefix lookup through the 128-bit trie, explain the IPv4 "
"root shortcut, and see how the trie doubles as the reputation store fed "
"by the cluster."
msgstr "在 128 位字典树中追踪一次最长前缀查找，解释 IPv4 的根捷径，并了解这棵字典树如何兼作由集群供数的信誉存储。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:84
msgid ""
"One binary trie over 128-bit keys serves both families: IPv6 prefixes are "
"inserted as-is, IPv4 prefixes are mapped into ``::ffff:0:0/96`` so a "
"``/24`` becomes a depth-120 path. Nodes live in one flat ``Vec`` indexed "
"by ``u32`` with index zero as both root and \"no child\", so a lookup is "
"at most 128 dependent loads with no pointer chasing. The trie is the "
"``PrefixTrie`` of the ``sibuna-cidr`` crate."
msgstr ""
"一棵基于 128 位键的二叉字典树同时服务两个地址族：IPv6 前缀按原样插入，IPv4 前缀被映射到 ``::ffff:0:0/96`` "
"中，因此一个 ``/24`` 会成为深度为 120 的路径。节点存放在一个以 ``u32`` 为索引的扁平 ``Vec`` "
"中，索引零既表示根也表示“无子节点”，因此一次查找最多是 128 次相互依赖的读取，没有指针追逐。这棵字典树就是 ``sibuna-cidr`` "
"crate 中的 ``PrefixTrie``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:86
msgid ""
"Walking the 96 mapped-prefix levels for every IPv4 lookup would cost 96 "
"dependent loads before it reached the first bit of the IPv4 address. So "
"the trie records the node at depth 96 at initialisation and starts IPv4 "
"lookups there:"
msgstr ""
"如果每次 IPv4 查找都走完映射前缀的 96 层，那么在到达 IPv4 地址的第一个比特之前，就要付出 96 "
"次相互依赖的读取。因此，字典树在初始化时记录深度 96 处的节点，并从那里开始 IPv4 查找："

#: ../../algorithms.rst:88
msgid ""
"let (mut node, mut depth, mut best) = if is_ipv4_mapped(key) {\n"
"    let start = self.ipv4_root;\n"
"    let value = self.nodes[start as usize].value.as_ref();\n"
"    (start, IPV4_DEPTH, value.or(self.nodes[0].value.as_ref()))\n"
"} else {\n"
"    (0, 0, self.nodes[0].value.as_ref())\n"
"};"
msgstr ""
"let (mut node, mut depth, mut best) = if is_ipv4_mapped(key) {\n"
"    let start = self.ipv4_root;\n"
"    let value = self.nodes[start as usize].value.as_ref();\n"
"    (start, IPV4_DEPTH, value.or(self.nodes[0].value.as_ref()))\n"
"} else {\n"
"    (0, 0, self.nodes[0].value.as_ref())\n"
"};"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:98
msgid ""
"Classifying an IPv4 address costs 32.0 ns and an IPv6 address 79.3 ns "
"(``ipv4_cidr_classification`` and ``ipv6_cidr_classification`` in "
"``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.md``). The engine consults the "
"trie twice: terminal ``allow``/``deny`` verdicts before the rule table, "
"so a cluster-wide ban beats every rule, and ``challenge`` verdicts after "
"it."
msgstr ""
"分类一个 IPv4 地址耗时 32.0 ns，一个 IPv6 地址耗时 79.3 "
"ns（``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.md`` 中的 "
"``ipv4_cidr_classification`` 和 "
"``ipv6_cidr_classification``）。引擎会查询字典树两次：在规则表之前查询终止性的 ``allow``/``deny`` "
"判定，使集群范围的封禁优先于每条规则；在规则表之后查询 ``challenge`` 判定。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:100
msgid "The Semantic Firewall"
msgstr "语义防火墙"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:105
msgid ""
"Understand the byte-class pre-scan, the tagged signature automaton, the "
"SQL tokenizer with tautology detection, the HTML and shell structure "
"checks, canonicalisation, and the false-positive discipline that a real "
"browser request must pass untouched."
msgstr ""
"理解字节类预扫描、带标记的签名自动机、带恒真式检测的 SQL 分词器、HTML 和 shell "
"结构检查、规范化，以及误报纪律：真实的浏览器请求必须原封不动地通过。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:107
msgid "A Lesson in False Positives"
msgstr "关于误报的一课"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:110
msgid ""
"The first version of the WAF matched a flat substring list against every "
"header. The list contained ``/*``, and every browser sends ``Accept: "
"text/html,...,*/*;q=0.8``. Every real browser was classified as SQL "
"injection and received ``403``. The lesson shaped the design: a detector "
"may fire only on *structure*, and the test suite now passes a complete "
"Chrome request, including a comment body containing ``select``, ``--``, "
"and an apostrophe, through the engine and asserts it comes out clean."
msgstr ""
"WAF 的第一个版本把一个扁平的子串列表与每个请求头进行匹配。列表中包含 ``/*``，而每个浏览器都会发送 ``Accept: "
"text/html,...,*/*;q=0.8``。于是每个真实的浏览器都被分类为 SQL 注入，并收到 "
"``403``。这一教训塑造了设计：检测器只能针对 *结构* 触发；测试套件现在会让一个完整的 Chrome 请求（包括一个含有 "
"``select``、``--`` 和撇号的评论正文）通过引擎，并断言它被判定为干净。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:112
msgid "Byte Classes in One Pass"
msgstr "单遍收集字节类"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:115
msgid ""
"Each inspected field is scanned once to collect which byte classes occur: "
"quotes, ``=``, ``<``, shell separators, ``%``, NUL, canonicalisation "
"triggers, and double spaces. Every detector consults the classes instead "
"of rescanning, and the canonicalised second pass runs only when a trigger "
"was seen. The scan is a 256-entry table lookup per byte, from the WAF "
"module of ``sibuna-policy``. Four accumulators keep the OR chains short, "
"and the two byte pairs (``/*`` and two adjacent spaces) are searched for "
"only when no single byte has already demanded canonicalisation:"
msgstr ""
"每个被检查的字段只扫描一遍，收集其中出现了哪些字节类：引号、``=``、``<``、shell "
"分隔符、``%``、NUL、规范化触发字节和连续空格。每个检测器都查询这些字节类，而不是重新扫描；只有出现了触发字节时，才运行规范化后的第二遍。扫描对每个字节查一次 "
"256 项的表，代码来自 ``sibuna-policy`` 的 WAF 模块。四个累加器使 OR "
"链保持简短；只有当没有任何单个字节已经要求规范化时，才搜索两种字节对（``/*`` 和两个相邻的空格）："

#: ../../algorithms.rst:117
msgid ""
"pub(crate) fn scan(text: &[u8]) -> Classes {\n"
"    let (chunks, remainder) = text.as_chunks::<8>();\n"
"    // Four accumulators keep the OR chains short so the loads can issue back to back.\n"
"    let mut lanes = [0u16; 4];\n"
"    for chunk in chunks {\n"
"        lanes[0] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[0])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[4])];\n"
"        lanes[1] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[1])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[5])];\n"
"        lanes[2] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[2])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[6])];\n"
"        lanes[3] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[3])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[7])];\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut bits = lanes[0] | lanes[1] | lanes[2] | lanes[3];\n"
"    for &byte in remainder {\n"
"        bits |= TABLE[usize::from(byte)];\n"
"    }\n"
"    // The pairs matter only while no single byte has demanded canonicalisation yet.\n"
"    if bits & CANONICAL == 0\n"
"        && ((bits & SPACE != 0 && has_pair(text, b' ', b' '))\n"
"            || (bits & (SLASH | STAR) == SLASH | STAR && has_pair(text, b'/', b'*')))\n"
"    {\n"
"        bits |= CANONICAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"    Classes { bits }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"pub(crate) fn scan(text: &[u8]) -> Classes {\n"
"    let (chunks, remainder) = text.as_chunks::<8>();\n"
"    // 四个累加器让 OR 链保持很短，使各次加载可以背靠背地发出。\n"
"    let mut lanes = [0u16; 4];\n"
"    for chunk in chunks {\n"
"        lanes[0] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[0])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[4])];\n"
"        lanes[1] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[1])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[5])];\n"
"        lanes[2] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[2])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[6])];\n"
"        lanes[3] |= TABLE[usize::from(chunk[3])] | TABLE[usize::from(chunk[7])];\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut bits = lanes[0] | lanes[1] | lanes[2] | lanes[3];\n"
"    for &byte in remainder {\n"
"        bits |= TABLE[usize::from(byte)];\n"
"    }\n"
"    // 只有当还没有任何单个字节要求规范化时，这些字节对才有意义。\n"
"    if bits & CANONICAL == 0\n"
"        && ((bits & SPACE != 0 && has_pair(text, b' ', b' '))\n"
"            || (bits & (SLASH | STAR) == SLASH | STAR && has_pair(text, b'/', b'*')))\n"
"    {\n"
"        bits |= CANONICAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"    Classes { bits }\n"
"}"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:143
msgid "Detectors"
msgstr "检测器"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:146
msgid ""
"*Signatures.* All strong signatures of every category live in one tagged "
"automaton; a hit is a terminal ``deny`` named ``waf:sqli``, ``waf:xss``, "
"``waf:path-traversal``, or ``waf:rce``."
msgstr ""
"*签名。* 所有类别的所有强签名都位于同一个带标记的自动机中；命中即为终止性的 ``deny``，名称为 "
"``waf:sqli``、``waf:xss``、``waf:path-traversal`` 或 ``waf:rce``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:147
msgid ""
"*SQL injection.* A single-pass word scanner looks up each alphanumeric "
"word (at most seven bytes) in the keyword table and, on ``or`` / ``and``, "
"checks for a ``literal = literal`` tautology; ``id=1 or 1=1`` is "
"terminal. Otherwise a quote byte is mandatory and the evidence must score "
"at least 4 out of: quote (1), up to two keywords (2), a comment marker "
"(1), an ``=`` (1). ``admin'--`` is terminal by itself. \"it's a group "
"order from the shop\" scores 3 and passes."
msgstr ""
"*SQL 注入。* 一个单遍的单词扫描器在关键字表中查找每个字母数字单词（最多七个字节），遇到 ``or`` / ``and`` 时检查是否存在 "
"``literal = literal`` 形式的恒真式；``id=1 or 1=1`` 是终止性的。否则必须出现引号字节，并且证据得分至少为 "
"4，计分项为：引号（1），最多两个关键字（2），注释标记（1），一个 ``=``\\ （1）。``admin'--`` "
"本身就是终止性的。“it's a group order from the shop” 得 3 分，可以通过。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:148
msgid ""
"*Cross-site scripting.* Requires ``<``; fires when a tag that can host "
"script co-occurs with an ``on<event>=`` attribute in attribute position. "
"``onboarding=1`` does not count."
msgstr ""
"*跨站脚本。* 要求出现 ``<``；当一个可以承载脚本的标签与处于属性位置的 ``on<event>=`` "
"属性同时出现时触发。``onboarding=1`` 不算。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:149
msgid ""
"*Command injection.* Requires a separator; fires when ``;``, ``|``, "
"``&&``, ``$(``, a backtick, or a newline is followed by a known command "
"name. ``status ok; done | next`` passes."
msgstr ""
"*命令注入。* 要求出现分隔符；当 "
"``;``、``|``、``&&``、``$(``、反引号或换行后面跟着一个已知的命令名时触发。``status ok; done | "
"next`` 可以通过。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:150
msgid ""
"*Path traversal.* Signatures (``../``, ``..%2f``, ``/etc/passwd``, "
"``id_rsa``, ...) plus NUL and ``%00``."
msgstr ""
"*路径遍历。* 签名（``../``、``..%2f``、``/etc/passwd``、``id_rsa`` 等），外加 NUL 和 "
"``%00``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:152
msgid ""
"Structural headers whose grammar legitimately contains quotes and stars "
"(``Accept*``, ``Content-Type``, ``Sec-*``, ``If-*``, ...) are skipped; "
"the path, query, User-Agent, other headers, and the first 8 KB of the "
"body are inspected, and fields with percent escapes, plus signs, comment "
"openers, or collapsible whitespace are canonicalised into an 8 KB stack "
"buffer and inspected again, so ``1%27/**/UnIoN/**/SeLeCt`` and "
"``%252e%252e/`` collapse onto the raw signatures."
msgstr ""
"语法中合法地包含引号和星号的结构性请求头（``Accept*``、``Content-Type``、``Sec-*``、``If-*`` "
"等）会被跳过；路径、查询、User-Agent、其他请求头以及请求体的前 8 KB "
"会被检查。含有百分号转义、加号、注释起始符或可折叠空白的字段，会被规范化到一个 8 KB 的栈缓冲区中再检查一次，因此 "
"``1%27/**/UnIoN/**/SeLeCt`` 和 ``%252e%252e/`` 都会归结为原始签名。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:154
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "成本"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:157
msgid ""
"The inspection cost depends on the fields and bytes presented to the engine, not just the number of requests. The benchmark chapter reports separate Gate, Shield, and 8 KB body cases. The 8 KB bound is an inspection limit, not a claim that the rest of an upload is safe. An ingress using forward-auth must pass the relevant request information; omitted bytes cannot be inspected by this process."
msgstr ""
"检查成本取决于提交给引擎的字段和字节，而不仅仅是请求的数量。基准测试一章分别报告了 Gate、Shield 和 8 KB 请求体的情形。8 KB 的上界是一个检查限制，并不意味着上传内容的其余部分是安全的。使用 forward-auth 的入口代理必须传递相关的请求信息；被省略的字节无法由这个进程检查。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:159
msgid "The Declarative Policy Engine"
msgstr "声明式策略引擎"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:164
msgid ""
"Read the rule model, the evaluation order, WEIGH scoring with thresholds, "
"and the JSON policy grammar."
msgstr "阅读规则模型、评估顺序、带阈值的 WEIGH 评分，以及 JSON 策略语法。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:166
msgid ""
"A rule is a conjunction of optional criteria (path pattern, User-Agent "
"pattern, up to four headers, up to eight IPv4/IPv6 CIDR blocks, one JA4 "
"fingerprint or prefix) with an action ``ALLOW``, ``DENY``, ``CHALLENGE``, "
"or ``WEIGH``, optional per-rule difficulty in work bits and algorithm, "
"and a signed ``weight``. Evaluation order:"
msgstr ""
"一条规则是若干可选条件的合取（路径模式、User-Agent 模式、最多四个请求头、最多八个 IPv4/IPv6 CIDR 块、一个 JA4 "
"指纹或前缀），带有一个动作 ``ALLOW``、``DENY``、``CHALLENGE`` 或 "
"``WEIGH``，可选的按规则设定的难度（以工作比特计）和算法，以及一个有符号的 ``weight``。评估顺序如下："

#: ../../algorithms.rst:168
msgid "Semantic WAF (Shield only): violation is a terminal ``deny``."
msgstr "语义 WAF（仅 Shield）：违规即为终止性的 ``deny``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:169
msgid "Reputation trie: ``deny`` or ``allow`` prefixes are terminal."
msgstr "信誉字典树：``deny`` 或 ``allow`` 前缀是终止性的。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:170
msgid ""
"Rules in order: the first terminal match returns; ``WEIGH`` matches "
"accumulate."
msgstr "按顺序评估规则：第一个终止性匹配直接返回；``WEIGH`` 匹配累加分数。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:171
msgid ""
"Score: negative totals ``allow``; totals :math:`\\geq 40` ``deny``; "
"totals :math:`\\geq 10` ``challenge`` with one extra work bit per 5 "
"points above the threshold, capped at six."
msgstr ""
"分数：总分为负时 ``allow``；总分 :math:`\\geq 40` 时 ``deny``；总分 :math:`\\geq 10` 时 "
"``challenge``，超过阈值的部分每 5 分增加一个工作比特，最多增加六个。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:172
msgid ""
"Static bypass paths, then trie ``challenge`` verdicts, then the bot "
"automaton."
msgstr "静态绕过路径，然后是字典树的 ``challenge`` 判定，然后是机器人自动机。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:173
msgid "Default action, ``challenge`` unless the policy file says otherwise."
msgstr "默认动作，除非策略文件另有规定，否则为 ``challenge``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:175
msgid ""
"Built-in rules allow ``/.well-known/*``, ``/favicon.ico``, "
"``/robots.txt``, and ``/__sibuna/*``, deny ``CF-Worker`` clients and "
"``Amazonbot``, and challenge every ``Mozilla`` User-Agent: a browser "
"string is free to forge, so admitting it would make the gate decorative."
msgstr ""
"内置规则放行 ``/.well-known/*``、``/favicon.ico``、``/robots.txt`` 和 "
"``/__sibuna/*``，拒绝 ``CF-Worker`` 客户端和 ``Amazonbot``，并对每个 ``Mozilla`` "
"User-Agent 发起挑战：浏览器字符串可以随意伪造，准入它会让网关形同虚设。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:177
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"default_action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"  \"waf\": true,\n"
"  \"thresholds\": { \"challenge_at\": 10, \"deny_at\": 40, \"bits_step\": 5 },\n"
"  \"ip_rules\": { \"10.0.0.0/8\": \"ALLOW\", \"2001:db8::/32\": \"DENY\" },\n"
"  \"rules\": [\n"
"    { \"name\": \"internal-api\", \"path\": \"/api/*\", \"headers\": { \"X-Api-Key\": \".*\" },\n"
"    \"action\": \"ALLOW\" },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"checkout\", \"path\": \"/checkout/*\", \"action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"      \"challenge\": { \"difficulty\": 20, \"algorithm\": \"posw\" } },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"headless\", \"user_agent\": \"Headless\", \"action\": \"WEIGH\", \"weight\": 30 },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"no-language\", \"headers\": { \"Accept-Language\": \"\" },\n"
"    \"action\": \"WEIGH\", \"weight\": -5 }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"default_action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"  \"waf\": true,\n"
"  \"thresholds\": { \"challenge_at\": 10, \"deny_at\": 40, \"bits_step\": 5 },\n"
"  \"ip_rules\": { \"10.0.0.0/8\": \"ALLOW\", \"2001:db8::/32\": \"DENY\" },\n"
"  \"rules\": [\n"
"    { \"name\": \"internal-api\", \"path\": \"/api/*\", \"headers\": { \"X-Api-Key\": \".*\" },\n"
"    \"action\": \"ALLOW\" },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"checkout\", \"path\": \"/checkout/*\", \"action\": \"CHALLENGE\",\n"
"      \"challenge\": { \"difficulty\": 20, \"algorithm\": \"posw\" } },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"headless\", \"user_agent\": \"Headless\", \"action\": \"WEIGH\", \"weight\": 30 },\n"
"    { \"name\": \"no-language\", \"headers\": { \"Accept-Language\": \"\" },\n"
"    \"action\": \"WEIGH\", \"weight\": -5 }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:195
msgid "Worked Trace: an Encoded Attack with a Valid Session"
msgstr "逐步追踪：持有有效会话的编码攻击"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:198
msgid ""
"Consider ``GET /search?q=%2527%2520OR%25201%253D1`` from a client holding "
"a valid session. First the HTTP parser separates the path and query "
"without copying their bytes. Local limits run, then Shield inspects the "
"request. The percent sign marks the field for canonicalization. One "
"decoding pass exposes ``%27%20OR%201%3D1``; a second exposes ``' OR 1=1``."
msgstr ""
"考虑一个持有有效会话的客户端发出的 ``GET /search?q=%2527%2520OR%25201%253D1``。首先，HTTP "
"解析器在不复制字节的情况下分离路径和查询。接着执行本地限制，然后由 Shield 检查请求。百分号把该字段标记为需要规范化。第一遍解码得到 "
"``%27%20OR%201%3D1``；第二遍得到 ``' OR 1=1``。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:200
msgid ""
"The tokenizer now sees a quote, the keyword ``OR``, and equal literal "
"operands. A denial is a terminal policy result. The valid session does "
"not turn it into an allow: the session check only resolves a challenge "
"decision. The storage hook copies a bounded incident record; SQL runs "
"later. The response path need not hold the engine snapshot while an "
"origin connection is idle."
msgstr ""
"此时分词器看到一个引号、关键字 ``OR`` "
"和相等的字面量操作数。拒绝是终止性的策略结果。有效会话不会把它变成放行：会话检查只用于解决挑战决定。存储钩子复制一条有界的事件记录；SQL "
"稍后才执行。当源站连接空闲时，响应路径不必持有引擎快照。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:202
msgid "Exercise 6.1"
msgstr "练习 6.1"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:204
msgid ""
"Replace the payload with ``O'Reilly`` and then with ``order=1``. Why "
"should neither alone establish SQL injection? Give an example of a false "
"positive a substring-only detector could produce."
msgstr ""
"把载荷换成 ``O'Reilly``，再换成 ``order=1``。为什么单独其中任何一个都不应被认定为 SQL "
"注入？举出一个只做子串匹配的检测器可能产生的误报例子。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:206
msgid "Exercise 6.2"
msgstr "练习 6.2"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:208
msgid ""
"Write the byte-class table entries needed to add a detector for LDAP "
"injection (patterns such as ``)(|(``), and explain which existing class "
"bits it can reuse."
msgstr "写出为 LDAP 注入（例如 ``)(|(`` 这样的模式）增加一个检测器所需的字节类表项，并解释它可以复用哪些现有的类比特。"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:210
msgid "Explain the invariant"
msgstr "解释这个不变量"

#: ../../algorithms.rst:212
msgid ""
"Explain to a reviewer why ``Accept: */*`` was a false positive, what "
"structural property the new SQL detector requires, and how the automaton "
"and the tokenizer divide the work."
msgstr ""
"向审阅者解释为什么 ``Accept: */*`` 曾是一个误报，新的 SQL 检测器要求什么样的结构性质，以及自动机和分词器如何分工。"
